{"2772020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ranger Force", "steam_appid": 2772020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this couple on an atmospheric journey, as they travel to different areas around the world, in search of pieces of a mysterious space rock that crashed onto Earth right where they happened to be hanging out. The rock exploded, causing its energy to alter their DNA, leaving them with enhanced human abilities and superhuman powers. They must find every scattered piece of the mysterious space rock, and destroy them, because the government is in search of the pieces as well and have corrupt plans for when the pieces are collected! The couple will fight, swim, parkour, climb, and shoot their way through each stage to retrieve and destroy each piece of the rock, to ensure the evil plans of the government don't go through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1 or 2 Players (Split-Screen Co-op)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>XBOX or USB Gamepad Controller Required</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Enjoy the game alone, or with a friend in split-screen co-op!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVENTUROUS &amp; ATMOSPHERIC!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772020/extras/3f180cbcef722b5396fa7cec94ab6123.poster.avif?t=1776309687\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772020/extras/3f180cbcef722b5396fa7cec94ab6123.webm?t=1776309687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772020/extras/3f180cbcef722b5396fa7